Package: surveyverse
Title: Easily Install and Load the 'Surveyverse' Packages
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Jacob", "Dennen", , "jdenn0514@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-3006-7364"))
Description: The 'surveyverse' is a collection of R packages designed for
    survey research, sharing a common design philosophy, grammar, and data
    structures. Install and load the core surveyverse packages with a single
    call to `library(surveyverse)`. Learn more at
    <https://jdenn0514.github.io/surveyverse/>.
